# All image-bearing folders and derived archives are gitignored. The repo
# tracks only the metadata + captions + scripts that reproduce them.
#
# raw/ and rejected/ are already gitignored via the repo-root rule
# `datasets/**/raw/` (raw/) — listed here for clarity and to cover the
# sibling folders.
raw/
rejected/
validation/
_civitai_staging/
*.zip

# Intermediate audit artefacts from the sourcing script
_commons_meta.csv
_commons_rejects.csv

# Originals backup created by apply_crops.py (kept locally for re-runs)
raw_orig/

# Gemini audit JSON; trace-data, not text-of-record
review.json
review_pass2.json
processed.json
gallery.html

# Gallery state (server-side persistence of flags + manual crops).
# Live on disk so user work survives browser/code/origin changes. The JSON
# is local-only (it's your in-progress curation); the backups + log are
# audit-only. None of these go in git.
gallery-state.json
gallery-state.log.jsonl
gallery-state.backups/

# Perceptual-hash cache used by build_gallery.py to cluster near-duplicates.
# Pure derived data; regenerated from raw/ if missing.
phashes.json
